OL,3,GNEWSAI should be dead or in prison -
OL,4,Anow I'm reunited with the teacher who
OL,5,Achanged my life
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut he said a few "anchors" helped him
OL,8,Fto lay the foundations for adulthood.
OL,9,FNow, the BBC has helped to reunite the
OL,10,F33-year-old with one of them - his
OL,11,Fformer teacher who "saw past" Sam being
OL,12,Fa child in foster care.
